Z||000000||Little Duce Coupe||12-14-2001||01:26 PM||||<BR>Long ago...(really before rice was rice) when I used to go cruising,<BR>I had the pleasure of witnessing the following.<P><BR>My friends and I are sitting at a Taco Bell watching the cruise and showing off our bikes (yes rice motorcycles...but thats different).<P>When accross the street we see....<BR>An early 70's Toyota Celica trying to show off (burn out) as he turns off the drag and goes to turn around in the back of Der Wienersnitchel, to be "cool" he is only running is running lights.<BR>Apparently since it didn't do much as he turned off the street he thought he would do it again behind the drive in where it's wet and so much "cooler".<BR>We hear it rev. and the back end cut loose as he is coming out from behind the drive in, in an attempt to go diagonal to the next parking lot.<BR>What this idiot didn't seem to notice was the next parking lot was about 6" lower than the one he was in and bordered by parking blocks......<BR>YES you guesed it...my friends and I are hooting and hollering (with joy) as we watch this guy remove his oil pan and front suspension and high side himself on the blocks the oil pouring out from under the car.<P>Ahhh.... so sweet.. you should have been there life every now and then gives you a perfect seat to watch the fool... be a BIGGER fool.  We alway wondered what his parents said when he called them for a tow or help.<P>Thanks for the laugh.... it was fun to type.<BR><P>------------------<BR>Little Duce Coupe<BR>"You Don't Know What She Costs"||||reg||10
